                <pb facs="0928" n="808" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg808"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                        Griscom.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-06-08"><hi rendition="#italic">June 8,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Please inform Department without delay when you present my cablegram of this
                    morning to the Japanese Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
